# Fear of Impostors (flash, 3/2): "When this creature enters, counter target spell. Its controller manifests dread." Bot1 holds a Black Lotus and flashes the
# Impostors in (CR 702.8a) on Bot2's turn 2 while Bot2's Grizzly Bears is on the stack. The trigger counters the Bears (CR 701.6) and then Bot2, the spell's
# controller and not the Impostors' (CR 701.62a), manifests dread: it looks at Lightning Bolt and Mountain, puts the Bolt face down as a 2/2 and the Mountain
# into its graveyard. Bot1 manifests nothing.

